{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWM_SECTION_7_9_5_2_Slave_Core_STARTUP","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_ECUStateManager","page":83,"text":"7.9.5.2 Slave Core STARTUP\n[SWS_EcuM_04145]\nUpstream requirements: SRS_ModeMgm_00001\n⌈The EcuM EcuM_AL_DriverInitZero and EcuM_AL_DriverInitOne functions\nshall be called by the EcuM_Init function on each core. The implementation of these\ncallout functions shall ensure that only those MCAL modules are initialized that run on\nthe currently active core.⌋\n[SWS_EcuM_04017] Slave Core StartPreOS Sequence\nUpstream requirements: SRS_ModeMgm_00001\n⌈\nIntegration Code\nEcuM\nopt Configuration data inconsistent\nOs\n\u0001\n\u0002\n\u0003\n\u0004\n\u0006 \u0007\n\b\n\u0003\n\u000e\n\u000f\u0007\n\u0007\n\u0002\n\u0010\n\u0011 \u0010 \u0012\n\u0012\n\u0010\u0004\n\u0013\n\u0012\n\u0002\n\u000e\n\u0014\n\u0001\n\u0002\n\u0003\n\u0004\n\u0006 \u0007\n\b\n\u0015\nGetCoreID(CoreIdType)\nEcuM_DeterminePbConfiguration(EcuM_ConfigType*)\nStartOS(ECUM_DEFAULT_APP_MODE)\nEcuM_AL_DriverInitOne(const EcuM_ConfigType*)\nEcuM_ErrorHook(ECUM_E_CONFIGURATION_DATA_INCONSISTENT)\nEcuM_AL_DriverInitZero()\n⌋\n[SWS_EcuM_04018] Slave Core StartPostOS Sequence\nUpstream requirements: SRS_ModeMgm_00001\n⌈\nBswM\nEcuM\nloop over every BswM running in this core\nSchM\nOs\nGetCoreID(CoreIdType)\nBswM_Init(const BswM_ConfigType *)\nSchM_StartTiming()\nSchM_Init(const SchM_ConfigType*)\nSchM_Start(): Std_ReturnType\n⌋","caption":"7.9.5.2 Slave Core STARTUP","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWM_SECTION_7_9_5_2_Slave_Core_STARTUP","releases":["R23-11"],"page":78,"hash":"5aa1bec8a04674aa","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWM_SECTION_7_9_5_2_Slave_Core_STARTUP","releases":["R24-11"],"page":86,"hash":"e9b6e97b2fa757a3","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWM_SECTION_7_9_5_2_Slave_Core_STARTUP","releases":["R25-11"],"page":83,"hash":"566d654b5c8d971f","caption":""}],"releases":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constit